          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Field researchers who supported in collecting data:<br>\n• Halle – CGE (DE) Ammalia Podlaszewska, Zafar Saydaliev, Shauna Shanmugan, Daniela Schmitt<br>\n• Silesia – UEKAT (PL) Adam Drobniak, Tomasz Ingram, Monika Wieczorek-Kosmala, Artur Ochojski, Adam Polko, Piotr Rykała<br>\n• Istria – FTHM (HR) Sabina Hodžić, Tanja Fatur Šikić<br>\n• Prahova – MKBT (RO) Marina Batog, Alexandra Lulache, Ana-Maria Elian<br>\n• Leon - RMIT-EU (ES) Adriana Veran, Nevelina Pachova<br>\n• Stara Zagora – UNWE (BG) Nadya Parpulova, Christina Nikolova<br>\n• Hainaut – Uliege (BE) Jessica Clement, Maria Jose Ruiz Riviera"
